<title>USA: Cooler Oct in upper Mississppi Valley, New Eng-NWS.</title>
<headline>Cooler Oct in upper Mississppi Valley, New Eng-NWS.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Weather Service on Thursday said it expects below-normal temperatures during October for the upper Mississippi Valley and New York and central New England.</p>
<p>The service made no predictions for above- or below-normal precipitation in October.</p>
<p>The next 30-day outlook will be issued October 17.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8317</p>
</text>
